WEBVTT

00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:33.641
I had brought very little money with me;
around three and a half dollars.

00:03:35.141 --> 00:03:38.591
So I used to eat every second day -
every other day -

00:03:38.591 --> 00:03:41.683
so that I can save as much as I can.

00:03:43.983 --> 00:03:47.614
Yes, good things take time,
but they do happen.

00:03:47.984 --> 00:03:50.456
And finally, it happened to me.

00:03:50.906 --> 00:03:56.326
I was given an opportunity to work
in a primary school, as a teacher.

00:03:56.826 --> 00:03:59.463
Wow, I was so happy.